PI PORT
-------

Native Pi package adaptation by Ed Heltzel, 2026-07-29.

Changes include a TypeScript preflight gate for Pi write and edit calls,
Pi-native package and skill metadata, self-contained Layer 0 skill resources,
native local installation documentation, and conversion of Claude agent definitions into
optional, non-discoverable worker-role references. The Pi port does not claim
tool isolation, fixed models, bounded turns, or fresh contexts for those role
references.

The original Claude plugin manifests and hooks are not copied. `index.ts`
adapts the Apache-licensed house-style hook behavior to Pi's extension API.

