Claude Blog Brain, wiki substance scorer
----------------------------------------
`scripts/score_substance.py` is a port and generalisation of the
check_wiki_substance and score_wiki_substance functions from a sibling project
by the same author. Thresholds were retained unchanged.

claude-blog prose linter
------------------------
`scripts/lint_voice.py` cleanly reimplements the fence-aware and
backtick-aware dash-detection design from claude-blog 2.1.0. It neither imports
nor executes claude-blog code at runtime.

DEPENDENCIES
============

The scanners use the Python standard library only. The Pi extension declares
Pi itself as a peer dependency and has no third-party runtime dependency.
